{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はあみ、らりんと朝日新聞の\n乃木坂と、まなぶのお仕事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台女優の笹本玲奈さんに\n取材をしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても素敵な方でした...！\nめっちゃ綺麗！\n緊張したうおおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切なことをまなびました。\nまた新しい気持ちが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笹本さんは舞台稽古真っ只中。\n私たちも16人のプリンシパルdeuxの\n稽古真っ只中。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...本当に良い機会をいただけて\nとても嬉しかったです。\n嬉しい！ラッキーだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お忙しい中、貴重な時間を\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ書きたいけど...\n掲載をお楽しみに♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼稽古の休憩中／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/19/6850642/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか、まひろ、まいまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろと私は紫芋の入ったパン\nみたいなデザート食べてる。\n美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/19/6850642/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"げへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで頑張ってるよ。\n演技楽しいです。\n今、新しい気持ちです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日明後日と京都で握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/19/6850642/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握はせいたんとペア"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/19/6850642/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんと初めてやな。\nあ、同い年です←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12レーン行くしか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/19/6850642/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の名は希望の衣装。\n耳赤い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}